            "sections": {
                "preamble": "Executive Summary\nTFC Optical (300394.SZ) delivered solid 9M 2026 results driven by AI/data-center optical demand. Q3 sequential acceleration and ongoing share buyback for cancellation support near-term activity; CPO products in volume delivery with 2027 ramp expected. Share price declined sharply on 16 Nov.",
