                "evidence": "Company 2026 Q3 report (28 Oct 2026, cninfo/SZSE); buyback progress announcement (15 Nov 2026); shareholder resolution (9 Nov 2026); price quotes from JRJ, CFI, Yahoo Finance (16 Nov 2026). Analyst notes (e.g., Citic, 6 Nov) reference same figures but are secondary.",
                "reasoning": "Revenue and profit growth reflect sustained hyperscaler demand for high-speed optics; material supply improvement enabled Q3 sequential lift. Strategic inventory and CPO volume delivery position for 2027 expansion. Buyback signals management confidence amid price correction from earlier highs. Cash conversion (OCF/net profit ~0.70x) trails profit growth, consistent with inventory build.",
