                "conclusion": "Fundamentals remain supported by AI optical demand and early CPO traction; operational momentum positive through Q3. Valuation and near-term price action are secondary to verified growth metrics.\n\nConfidence Level\n0.78\n\n[{\"name\":\"TFC 2026 Q3 report\",\"url\":\"disc.static.szse.cn\",\"published_at\":\"2026-10-28\",\"data_period\":\"2026Q3\",\"source_type\":\"company_filing\",\"verification_status\":\"verified\"},{\"name\":\"Buyback progress announcement\",\"url\":\"file.finance.sina.com.cn\",\"published_at\":\"2026-11-15\",\"data_period\":\"as of 2026-11-13\",\"source_type\":\"company_filing\",\"verification_status\":\"verified\"},{\"name\":\"Price quotes\",\"url\":\"summary.jrj.com.cn\",\"published_at\":\"2026-11-16\",\"data_period\":\"2026-11-16 close\",\"source_type\":\"exchange_data\",\"verification_status\":\"verified\"}]"
